    "stem": "A 45-year-old woman is experiencing progressive mental deterioration over a 6-hour period, 5 days after emergency evacuation of a large subarachnoid hemorrhage and clipping of a middle cerebral artery aneurysm. The MOST likely cause for deterioration is",
