    "stem": "A 25-year-old black man is brought to the emergency room unconscious. Supplemental oxygen is administered, and a pulse oximeter is placed on his finger and a reading of 98% is recorded. Arterial gas sampling at the same time shows PaO2 of 190 mm Hg, pH 7.2, and O2 saturation of 90%. Presence of which of the following could explain the discrepancies between these two readings?",
